### Health
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### Register citizen
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Test Citizen","email":"citizen@example.com","password":"SafeStreet123","area":"Central"}

### Login (paste token into subsequent Authorization headers)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"citizen@example.com","password":"SafeStreet123","role":"citizen"}

### Public reports
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports

### Routes
GET http://localhost:5000/api/routes

### Admin login (credentials from .env)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@safestreet.local","password":"ChangeMe123!","role":"admin"}
